            <description><![CDATA[<pre>DiscShift can now keep itself up to date.

- Check for new versions from the DiscShift menu or Settings.
- Choose automatic update checks and background downloads in Settings.
- Updates wait while a disc is scanning, exporting, or setup is running.
- Updates are verified with both DiscShift&#x27;s update signing key and Apple&#x27;s Developer ID signing.

If you&#x27;re upgrading from 0.8.2, install this version once from GitHub and move it to Applications. Future versions can update in the app.
</pre>]]></description>
